<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11932" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπερι-νόητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>incomprehensible,</i>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.581
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.1138
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inconceivable,</i> i.e. <i>indefinitely short,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					1p.10U.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unintelligent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				644.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>inadvisedly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.57.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inperceptibly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.145
			</span></i> codd. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπερί-οδος</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>not periodic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				26
			</span></i>.</div>
